abstract: >-
  Open-source energy-system capacity expansion, multi-duration storage, CO2
  cap-and-trade duality, ramp/reserve adequacy, meshed DC-OPF/AC-TEP and an
  explicit mean-CVaR stochastic program, plus a single-file offline interactive
  workbench rendered from solved models.
